            <ArticleTitle>Retraction notice to &quot;Obesity-Induced Increase in Tumor Necrosis Factor-α Leads to Development of Colon Cancer in Mice&quot; Gastroenterology 2012;143:741-753.e4.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>871</MedlinePgn>
